<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Correlation Between Overestimation (AC - RC) and True Performance for single domain specialized vs multiple models.</figcaption>
