<td id="S4.T4.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" rowspan="2"><span id="S4.T4.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">IEEE</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T4.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Spearman</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T4.5.4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.683</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T4.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5.863" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn mathsize="0.900em">5.863</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5.863</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T4.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T4.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><span id="S4.T4.5.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Kendall</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.T4.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.529</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><math id="S4.T4.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8.970" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn mathsize="0.900em">8.970</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8.970</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T4.5.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T4.5.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" rowspan="2"><span id="S4.T4.5.6.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TIOBE</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T4.5.6.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Spearman</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><span id="S4.T4.5.6.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.741</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T4.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.234" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.234</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.234</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T4.5.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T4.5.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="S4.T4.5.7.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Kendall</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><span id="S4.T4.5.7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">0.662</span></td>
<td id="S4.T4.5.7.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb"><math id="S4.T4.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.354" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn mathsize="0.900em">0.354</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.354</annotation></semantics></math></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
<div id="S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We also investigate the relationship between domain rarity and overconfidence.
Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Impact of Rarity of Programming Language ‣ 4.2 Analysis of Perceived Performance ‣ 4 Results ‣ Do Code Models Suffer from the Dunning-Kruger Effect?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> shows the correlation of perceived performance with
(a) GitHub ranking (most used languages on GitHub)
<cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib48" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ranking (2025a)</a></cite>, (b) IEEE popularity ranking <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib49" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ranking (2024)</a></cite>, and (c)
TIOBE index <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib50" title="" class="ltx_ref">Ranking (2025b)</a></cite>. Across all
three sources, we observe a consistent trend: models exhibit higher
overconfidence in rarer languages. For instance, GitHub ranking shows a correlation of 0.797 with perceived confidence, highlighting that rarity
is a predictor of overconfidence.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table ltx_align_floatright" style="width:60%;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>DKE measurement on code generation tasks.</figcaption>
